# AdvancedSoftware2Project
#Tips to run the project

For a Customer user: 

1-For any customer to use any service of the systme he should have an account (must sign up).
2-The user must write his email and password as path varibles in the url when using a service(http://localhost:8080/FinancialController/paywallet/a/1) "a" s email and 
"1" is password
3-If the customer wants to make a refund request he should have a complete transaction first to make a refund on it such as payment transaction
4-If the customer wants to check for a refund request he has done and the admin did not handle it he must be informed that his request is in waiting list in the case the request was handled by the admin the customer can check whether his request is accepted or rejected.
5-To sign in , the customer should enter his passowrd and email correctly.
6-when the customer search for a service he should search for the service with the exact name in the datbase(InternetPayment,mobileRecharge,Donations,MonthlyReceipt,QuarterReceipt)


For an admin user:

1-To do a service the admin must write his user name and password as path variables in the url (name "admin" password "12345").If the admin wrote a wrong name or password there will be a response that either of admin data is entered wrong.
2- when trying to add a new service name the new service name should not be one of the static services names in database passing the desired service as a path variable  (InternetPayment,mobileRecharge,Donations,MonthlyReceipt,QuarterReceipt)


*Project will run on java version 11 or any hiegher version.
